/* ---------------------------------------------------------
   CATEGORIES
   Every player lists ALL franchises they suited up for
   (teams: ["..."]) so a spin on any of those teams is a valid
   match — e.g. Sammy Sosa matches Rangers, White Sox, Cubs,
   or Orioles. Targets are set from the actual top-10 all-time
   sum for that stat: Hard ≈ the real top-10 total, Medium ≈
   two-thirds of it, Easy ≈ a bit under half — so a target is
   always something a real top-10 leaderboard could hit, and
   Hard genuinely requires several elite players.

   NOTE: this list is still a curated subset, not a full
   historical database — see build-roster-data.mjs (provided
   alongside this file) for a script that pulls a complete
   team-by-team roster from the Lahman database.
--------------------------------------------------------- */

